WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
1950.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.970
Detroit is the fifth-largest
city in the United States,

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:09.810
with 1,849,568 people.

4
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:15.530
By 2020, the census counted 639,111.

5
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.750
And most of the loss came early.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.590
By 1990, about two-thirds
of it had already gone.

7
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.890
So what emptied the Motor City?

8
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.230
A natural disaster?

9
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.290
War damage?

10
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.430
A merger with a neighbouring city?

11
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.970
In this mission, you'll follow people
as they move in and out of cities,

12
00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:37.170
and see why London's population
fell in the year to mid-2025.

13
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.710
Then you'll weigh the
consequences for a shrinking city,

14
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:43.130
and ask whether Detroit
is turning a corner.

15
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.680
Your mission: explain what
emptied the Motor City.
